{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/g_YX-NpTBRNBaahN0HDX8w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:34.718997+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/g_YX-NpTBRNBaahN0HDX8w","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8plqQNSR6xdKEyJN3pZ7OggibnAqawiatZz0IbicTicbVlCDf9GGvDKicHKUu6ml7w0KvJ8QH4Uicatibg6qASWer2TQw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎报考深圳大学</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>测绘科学与技术学科</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span>2027级推荐免试硕士研究生</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>团队简介</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VmJFYVCVId1kGAnyUEUCZaXGlKM9aQQU4kicpiaicT22OfYxdlp2UBjU2IvFq5Wm3iaPESpg3JUkXcJld0Qa9LgQy91jIdoHEiaAhmc6cyic217ic4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>        深圳大学测绘科学与技术学科面向智能化测绘与数智化发展，旨在建设具有国际视野的测绘学科研究与人才培养高地。自2012年起，融合测绘与大数据，设立城市空间信息工程系和本科专业，2019年设立城市空间信息工程二级学科博士点，2025年获批测绘科学与技术一级学科博士点。</span></p><p><span>    深圳大学测绘学科现有中国工程院</span><strong><span>郭仁忠院士、李清泉院士、魏子卿院士</span></strong><span>三位学术带头人，建有亚热带建筑与城市科学全国重点实验室（共建），自然资源部大湾区地理环境监测重点实验室、自然资源部城市国土资源监测与仿真重点实验室、广东省粤港澳智慧城市联合实验室、广东省城市空间信息工程重点实验室、深圳市空间信息智能感知与服务重点实验室等国家、省、市级科研机构。获得国家技术发明奖、广东省科技进步奖、自然资源科技进步奖、测绘科技进步奖、地理信息科技进步奖、何梁何利科学与技术进步奖等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>导师信息请参见：</span></p><p><span><span>https://geospatial.szu.edu.cn/kjry/jsxl.htm</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>大地测量学与测量工程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>围绕基础设施形变测量、地下/水下空间自主测绘、室内外一体化定位与导航等问题，开展自主测绘与空间智能相关研究。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>摄影测量与遥感</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>围绕高精度三维重建、高分高光谱遥感、海洋与海岸带遥感监测等问题，开展自然资源监测与可持续发展相关研究。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>城市信息学与智慧城市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>围绕城市大数据分析、时空智能、数字孪生城市等问题，开展时空智能与智慧城市相关研究。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>接收专业</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1）081600 测绘科学与技术（学硕）</span></p><p><span>2）085704 测绘工程（专硕）</span></p><p><span>3）085410 人工智能（专硕）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人须为具有推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生，并在录取当年入学前取得国家承认的本科毕业证书。</span><span><span> </span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>符合以下条件之一即可申请报名：</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1）取得保研资格</span></p><p><span>2）就读于985、211、“双一流”高校</span></p><p><span>3）就读于其他具有推荐免试授权高校的优秀应届本科毕业生（择优录取）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式与选拔</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名：</span></strong><span>拟报考我校推免的同学，请登录“深圳大学2027年硕士研究生推免生招生预报名系统”进行报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>报名网址：</span></strong><span>http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>预报名截止时间：</span></strong><strong><span>9月20日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>选拔：</span></strong><span><span>学院将对申请材料进行审核，择优确定复试名单。经审核通过的申请人，学院将通过QQ群消息或邮件通知复试具体安排。复试时间预计为9月中下旬，具体形式及时间以学院通知为准。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>*已报名同学请务必加入2027深大建规推免QQ群，后续复试相关事宜将在群内通知。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/VmJFYVCVId1631CG87V3mC6lrlQMoO6P9YicOhnZrIYg99H0YKicHZg4Q9GgmpkOj6CcK4fW7rmRSfUDcN3hjLibCDCs1MT2E5q56huaZzicFfk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>供稿 | 马   丁</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 李亚楠</span></p><p><span>审核 | 涂   伟</span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8plqQNSR6xdKEyJN3pZ7OggibnAqawiatZ1IPvqB8RLHfJZhWbcN4kwToSkKVvEzia4pSasMYKVDFzfQY8RglJ7Hw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d921e4aa2ef3b10fbb245b3dd734504830f170bbcaf33bfdc70a977c9eb25242","textLength":1061,"sourceSha256":"2137280dbb4928c18a5defbb6f01ca38cc8eb1b4e4957e5af41a149c02b9aebe","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9e8503b249d75ef5426e","title":"2026年深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院城市空间信息工程系测绘科学与技术学科2027级推免预报名启动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:34.718997+00:00"}
